    bool "ANCS client"
    depends on NIMBLE
    select BT_GATT_CLIENT
    help
      Client of the Apple Notification Center Service of a connected iOS
      device (pbl/bluetooth/clients/ancs.h): its notifications, their
      attributes and their actions.
